# A Thunderbolt or USB4 device the kernel holds back (security level "user")
# comes up without its PCIe tunnels: a dock's Ethernet stays dark while its USB
# 2 and displays work. Ask every user manager to approve it;
# omarchy-hw-thunderbolt-enroll only does so for the owner of the active,
# unlocked local session, and leaves devices boltd already stores to boltd.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="thunderbolt", ENV{DEVTYPE}=="thunderbolt_device", ATTR{authorized}=="0", TAG+="systemd", ENV{SYSTEMD_USER_WANTS}+="omarchy-thunderbolt-enroll@%k.service"
